flowchart TD
    A["CLI: python -m benchmarks.run_agentic_matrix<br/>--trials --k --seed --target name|url|model"] --> B[matrix_manifest.json targets - your LLM endpoints]
    B --> C[Loop over model targets]
    C -->|LK_BASE_URL / LK_MODEL per target| D[run_agentic_suite - one model]

    subgraph SUITE[Agentic suite - deterministic tool verification, no LLM judge]
        D --> E1["react_live - single-shot tool-call reduction<br/>emits PER_TASK_JSON"]
        D --> E2["evolution_live - multi-round durability<br/>emits per_round curve"]
        D --> E3[injection_ablation - playbook quality lift = the gate]
        E1 --> F[_compute_suite_summary + gates]
        E2 --> F
        E3 --> F
    end

    F -->|per-model summary| G[(benchmarks/results/agentic_suite_*_summary.json)]
    C --> H[(benchmarks/results/agentic_matrix_*_summary.json)]

    G --> I["python -m benchmarks.make_results<br/>reads manifest-pinned raw runs"]
    I --> J[(benchmarks/RESULTS.json - canonical, committed)]
    I --> K[(benchmarks/MATRIX.md - rendered table)]
    I -->|--check| L{artifact drift?}
    L -->|stale| L1[CI fails - benchmark-artifact job]
    L -->|clean| L2[ok]

    J --> M[python -m benchmarks.seed_dashboard]
    M -->|one agent_learn run per benchmark task + procedural skills| N[(SQLite runs + records)]

    J --> O[FastAPI /api/v1/benchmarks]
    N --> O
    O --> P["React dashboard - Benchmarks page<br/>summary + per-task / per-round drill-down, no mock data"]

    I -.->|--run: reproduce live, then re-pin| A

